      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate veterinary doctors and attentive technicians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The medical team on West 77th Street receives outstanding praise for gentle bedside manners, patience, and clear explanations. Pet parents appreciate that veterinarians and veterinary nurses treat animals like family and offer treats to calm nervous pets, though one reviewer noted an unattended reception desk."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 27,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient care for dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients highlight the reassuring care provided to dogs and cats, from French bulldog puppies to geriatric cats. Reviewers appreciate that the clinical staff offers tasty treats to distract pets during physical examinations, blood draws, and vaccine administration, helping anxious pets feel comfortable throughout their visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Prompt treatment for urgent pet issues"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the veterinary center for reliable outcomes during sudden illnesses and routine wellness visits. Reviewers note that emergency treatments for stomach issues, allergic reactions, and sudden lethargy brought swift relief to their companions, helping pets recover quickly after prompt interventions."
      }
    }
  ],
